          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "13. 三酰甘油"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.129,
            0.708,
            0.145
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 存在于各种细胞中 b. 溶于水 c. 不作为能量储存物 d. 主要膳食脂肪"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.15,
            0.429,
            0.165
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "14. 可使细胞内 cAMP 水平降低的是"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.17,
            0.549,
            0.186
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 胰高血糖 b. 肾上腺素 c. 去甲肾上腺素 d. 胰岛"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.19,
            0.304,
            0.206
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "15. 胆汁盐 (胆质酸)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.21,
            0.83,
            0.226
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 是胆固醇的主要储存形式 b. 形成于胆囊中 c. 分泌到肠中 d. 对膳食中脂质消化不利"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.231,
            0.321,
            0.246
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "16. 如下叙述正确的是"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.251,
            0.848,
            0.287
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 维生素 D 源于胆固醇 b. 缺乏胆固醇会造成儿童佝偻病 c. 缺乏胆固醇会造成成人软骨病 d. 细胞膜中不含胆固醇"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.291,
            0.231,
            0.307
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "17. 脂蛋白"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.311,
            0.778,
            0.327
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 线性结构 b. 具有亲水性 c. 功能是三酰甘油等的体内运输 d. 不利于脂质溶解"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.332,
            0.285,
            0.347
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "18. 高密度脂蛋白"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.352,
            0.804,
            0.368
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 在肠道中合成 b. 经胞吞作用被肝脏吸收 c. 不能运输胆固醇 d. 与其他脂蛋白无关"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.372,
            0.251,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "19. 关于固氮"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.392,
            0.848,
            0.428
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 只要有固氮酶就可实现生物固氮 b. 多种微生物能够固氮 c. 具有固氮能力的微生物并非都是原核微生物 d. 将大气中的氮转化成氨称为固氮"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.433,
            0.321,
            0.448
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "20. 转氨酶催化的反应"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.453,
            0.743,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 是需能反应 b. 需输入代谢能 c. 反应可逆 d. 转氨基不作为其它反应辅酶"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.485,
            0.424,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "三、填空（共30分，每空1分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.508,
            0.848,
            0.726
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 18,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.508,
                0.705,
                0.524
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. 每个原核细胞都由 a 包围，没有 b 结构，只有折叠的 c 和 d。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 19,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.528,
                0.399,
                0.544
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 植物细胞壁由 a 和 b 构成。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 20,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.548,
                0.619,
                0.564
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 细胞骨架是一种纤维网络，主要由 a 、 b 和 c 组成。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 21,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.569,
                0.848,
                0.605
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 质膜环绕细胞, 具有特异的 a__ 蛋白, 是一种具有 b__ 屏障。当有 c__ 结合到质膜表面上的 d__ 蛋白, 以及在 e__ 和 f__ 过程中, 也能接受信息。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 22,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.609,
                0.646,
                0.625
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5. 脂双层中, 脂质之间不存在 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\underline{\\mathsf{a}}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": ", 所有膜不是 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\underline{\\mathsf{b}}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 而是 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\underline{\\mathsf{c}}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 23,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.629,
                0.649,
                0.645
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6. 脂锚定蛋白，不 a____，而是通过与 b____连接，并锚定在 c____上。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 24,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.649,
                0.848,
                0.685
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7. 限制性消化后的 DNA 片段，可以用 a__ 或 b__ 电泳，根据片段大小不同而分离。c__ 用于分离较小分子 DNA，而 d__ 可分离较大分子 DNA"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 25,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.689,
                0.848,
                0.726
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "8. 原位杂交中, 组织样品与 a__ 温育, 多余的 b__ 被洗掉, 然后检测 c__ 的位置。这种技术可用于基因 d__ 和单个基因 e__ 的定位"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.742,
            0.566,
            0.761
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "四、判断题。是(√)非(×)（共20分，每题1分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 35,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.765,
            0.634,
            0.902
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 28,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.765,
                0.514,
                0.78
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. cDNA 文库只包括以 mRNA 形式表达的序列。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 29,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.785,
                0.53,
                0.8
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 温和噬菌体的基因组不能整合到宿主基因组中。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 30,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.805,
                0.477,
                0.82
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 能导致细胞转化的病毒基因称为癌基因。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 31,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.825,
                0.555,
                0.841
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 直链淀粉中的葡萄糖之间靠  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\alpha(1 \\rightarrow 4)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "  糖苷键连接。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 32,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.846,
                0.634,
                0.862
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5. 单糖以糖苷键连接的短链称为寡糖，在糖蛋白中不存在寡糖。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 33,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.866,
                0.406,
                0.881
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6. 动物体内以糖原形式储存多糖。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 34,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.887,
                0.441,
                0.902
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7. 细菌和酵母以葡聚糖形式储存多糖。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
