          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 0,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.089,
                0.389,
                0.105
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "8. 纤维素是有分支结构的多糖。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 1,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.109,
                0.538,
                0.125
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "9. 植物细胞中，淀粉以不溶性胶粒存在于胞质中。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 2,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.13,
                0.397,
                0.146
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "10. 糖酵解的作用只是产生能量。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.15,
                0.432,
                0.165
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "11. 转酮酶和转醛酶反应是不可逆的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.171,
                0.538,
                0.186
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "12. 变构调节和激素控制共同调控糖原降解或合成。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.191,
                0.486,
                0.206
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "13. 少数脂肪酸有偶数碳原子，且不具侧链。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.211,
                0.672,
                0.226
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "14. 阿司匹林(乙酰水杨酸)能缓解炎症是基于它抑制前列腺素合成酶。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.231,
                0.643,
                0.246
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "15. 脂肪酸降解的速度是由血液中所得到的游离脂肪酸来调节的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.251,
                0.502,
                0.266
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "16. 脂肪酸分解代谢是长链脂肪酸的氧化反应。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.272,
                0.45,
                0.287
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "17. 线粒体含有 2 种脂酰辅酶 A 脱氢酶。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.292,
                0.51,
                0.307
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "18. 调节脂肪酸合成的关键是乙酰-CoA羧化酶。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.312,
                0.485,
                0.327
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "19. 磷酸化和去磷酸化接受 cAMP 水平调节。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.332,
                0.344,
                0.347
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "20. 孕激素在卵巢中合成。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
